et(query);\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(result, HttpStatus.OK);\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(ResponseMessage.fail(e.getMessage()), HttpStatus.OK);\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 导出供应商额度\n     */\n    @PostMapping(\"/exportSupplierQuota\")\n    public ResponseEntity<List<PmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet>> exportSupplierQuotaSet(@RequestBody PmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSetQO query) {\n        List<PmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet> result = pmcPortalFinancingService.exportSupplierQuotaSet(query);\n        return new ResponseEntity<>(result, HttpStatus.OK);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 保存供应商额度\n     */\n    @PostMapping(\"/saveOrUpdateSupplierQuota\")\n    public ResponseEntity<?> saveOrUpdateSupplierQuotaSet(@RequestBody PmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet dto) {\n        PmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet pmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet = new PmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet();\n        try {\n            Long id = pmcPortalFinancingService.saveOrUpdateSupplierQuotaSet(dto);\n            pmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet.setId(id);\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            log.error(\"saveOrUpdateSupplierQuotaSet error\", e);\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(ResponseMessage.fail(e.getMessage()), HttpStatus.OK);\n        }\n        return new ResponseEntity<>(pmcFinanceSupplierQuotaSet, HttpStatus.OK);\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/selectInit\")\n    public ResponseEntity<Object> selectInit() {\n        Map<String, Object> selectMap = pmcPortalFinancingService.getSelectInit();\n        return new ResponseEntity<>(selectMap, HttpStatus.OK);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 根据输入值模糊检索交易类型code和名称\n     * @param parameter\n     * @return\n     */\n    @PostMapping(value = \"/selectSuggest\")\n    public ResponseEntity<Object> selectSuggest(@RequestBody SuggestParameter parameter) {\n        List<CodeDesc> codeDescs = pmcPortalFinancingService.selectSuggest(parameter);\n        return new ResponseEntity<>(codeDescs, HttpStatus.OK);\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/